  "title": "PennantPark Floating Rate Capital Ltd. Announces Monthly Distribution of $0.0833 per Share",
  "summary": "MIAMI, July 02, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PennantPark Floating Rate Capital Ltd. (the \"Company\") (NYSE: PFLT) declares its monthly distribution for July 2026 of $0.0833 per share, comprised of an $0.08 per share base dividend and $0.0033 per share supplemental dividend, payable on August 3, 2026 to The post PennantPark Floating Rate Capital Ltd. Announces Monthly Distribution of $0.0833 per Share appeared first on PennantPark .",
